OL,3,GNEWSADerry City 'til I die' says fan
OL,4,Aafter victory in final
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerry City fans were in a triumphant
OL,7,Fmood after their team's win in the
OL,8,Ffinal at the FAI Cup in Dublin.
OL,10,FThe team managed a 1-0 win over
OL,11,FWaterford at the Aviva Stadium on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FOne fan travelled from America and
OL,15,Fprevious loses didn't put him off.
OL,17,FColm Kerrigan left JFK Airport on
OL,18,FSaturday night at about 21:30 EST and
OL,19,Farrived 8:30 GMT on Sunday morning at
OL,20,FDublin Airport to watch the final.
